
# DELETE API Requests

## Overview

This document provides examples of **DELETE API requests** for manual API testing. These requests demonstrate how resources such as users, products, and reviews can be deleted through an API.

Each example includes the HTTP method, endpoint, required headers, expected response status, response body, and relevant validation scenarios.

